          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: শকুন",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "শকুন — shôkun — \"a vulture\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "শকুন (shôkun) is Sanskrit śakuna, \"bird\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 12245). In Bengali it has narrowed to \"vulture\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
